## Cards inheriting image_width from card-grid

{% card-grid image_width=100 %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/gcp/" src="integrations_logos/google_cloud_platform.png" alt="GCP" /%}
{% image-card href="/integrations/azure/" src="integrations_logos/azure.png" alt="Azure" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Card overriding image_width

{% card-grid image_width=100 %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/datadog/" src="dd_logo_n_70x75.png" alt="Datadog" image_width=200 /%}
{% /card-grid %}

## Custom card_width

{% card-grid card_width=225 %}
{% image-card href="/integrations/aws/" src="integrations_logos/amazon_web_services.png" alt="AWS" /%}
{% /card-grid %}

